message: "To cite GeoPathSampleR in publications use:"
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: "GeoPathSampleR: Posterior Sampling of Geolocator Paths"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21944194
abstract: "Reconstructs bird migration trajectories from stationary-period likelihood maps built with GeoPressureR. A Gibbs sampler combines residence-dependent departure, a ground-speed distribution conditional on movement, and a prior on cumulative route distance between long periods. Provides posterior stay summaries and sampling diagnostics."
